WEBVTT

00:01:26.476 --> 00:01:30.252
I have met and studied
hundreds of entrepreneurs

00:01:30.252 --> 00:01:36.840
in India, China, Africa and South America,
and they keep amazing me.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:40.041
Many of them did not go to school.

00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:43.517
They don't invent stuff in big R&amp;D labs.

00:01:43.517 --> 00:01:46.550
The street is the lab.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:49.059
Why do they do that?

00:01:49.059 --> 00:01:52.526
Because they don't have the kind
of basic resources we take for granted,

00:01:52.526 --> 00:01:54.367
like capital and energy,

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:57.315
and basic services
like healthcare and education

00:01:57.315 --> 00:02:00.958
are also scarce in those regions.